 "text": "-->\nHome | Cie Norfolk\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHome\nCareers\nCIE Grower App\nFor a more robust grain experience, download the CIE grower app, or contact the Grains team to assist with 'grower' account setup.\nCIE Grower Portal\nCIE Grower Google Play\nCIE Grower Apple Store\nCorn Discount schedule\nCIE Norfolk Feed Tags\n​\n​ Corn Receiving Hours ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​​\nOctober 19th - October 23rd:\nMonday - Friday: 8am - 5pm\nSaturday: TBA\nSunday: Closed\n​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​\n​\nMWDG Loading Hours\nMonday - Friday: 6:00am - 4pm\nSaturday: 6:00am - 12pm\n​ ​\n​ ​ ​\nDDG Loading Hours\nMonday - Friday: Call\n​\n​\n​\n​​\n​\n​\nContact Info\nOffice - 402-844-2680\nJesse - 402-841-8507\nKim - 402-992-9673\nCash Bids\nContact Us\nFirst Name\nLast Name\nEmail\nPhone\nWrite a message\nSubmit\nThanks for submitting!\n(402) 844-2680\n3002 N Victory Rd, Norfolk, NE 68701\ninfo@cie.us\n©2022 by CIE\nbottom of page",
